# The ai-safety-audit skill ships shell and PowerShell bootstrap scripts under
# src/aisg/skills/ and in two mirrors (.claude/skills/, .agents/skills/) that a test
# compares byte-for-byte and parses with `sh -n`. With core.autocrlf=true, git would
# rewrite their line endings to CRLF on Windows checkout, breaking both; pin LF.
*.sh text eol=lf
*.ps1 text eol=lf
